 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kakekara Hajimaru Saigo No Hatsukoi"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "賭けからはじまる最後の初恋"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I can't be a heroine and there is no prince.\"\n\nIt has been a year since Nao and Satomura became true lovers. Riko feels left out, as if her best friend has been taken away from her, and she is fed up with Sosuke, a friend of Satomura's who often shows up at her place of work. Then her ex-boyfriend, who is also a trauma in Riko's past, shows up. What will happen to the love that begins with a new gamble between a woman who can't fall in love and a man who can't fall in love for real?!\n\n---\nNote: Sequel of \"Kake kara Hajimaru Sayonara no Koi.\"",
   "ja": "「私はヒロインになれないし、王子様なんていない」\n\n奈央と里村が本当の恋人になってから一年。\n親友をとられたみたいで、取り残された気持ちになっていた理子はたびたび勤め先に現れる里村の友人・宗佑に辟易していた。\n\nそんな中、理子の過去のトラウマでもある元カレが現れて――。\n\n惚れない女×本気の恋をしない男の新たな賭けからはじまる恋の行方は？"
  },
